
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>ColloAI Dashboard</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#0b1020;color:#edf2ff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{padding:22px;background:#141e33;border-bottom:1px solid #293651}
h1{margin:0;color:#f3c969}
main{max-width:800px;margin:auto;padding:16px}
.card{padding:18px;background:#141e33;border:1px solid #293651;border-radius:14px;margin-bottom:15px}
.label{font-size:13px;color:#aab5ce}
.value{font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;margin-top:9px}
p{line-height:1.5;color:#b7c4df}
button,a{display:block;width:100%;padding:14px;margin-top:12px;border:0;border-radius:9px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px}
button{background:#a83c4b;color:white}
a{background:#283550;color:white}
.gold{color:#f3c969}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>ColloAI GOLD BOT</h1>
<p>Trading dashboard · XAUUSD</p>
</header>
<main>
<div class="card">
<div class="label">MT5 CONNECTION</div>
<div class="value gold">Not connected</div>
<p>The trading engine has not been connected yet.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="label">GOLD SYMBOL</div>
<div class="value">XAUUSD</div>
<p>Gold market monitoring.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="label">BOT STATUS</div>
<div class="value" id="status">STOPPED</div>
<p>These controls are a website preview; they do not place trades.</p>
<button onclick="document.getElementById('status').textContent='PREVIEW ACTIVE';document.getElementById('message').textContent='Preview started. No trades are being placed.'">START PREVIEW</button>
<button onclick="document.getElementById('status').textContent='STOPPED';document.getElementById('message').textContent='Preview stopped.'">STOP PREVIEW</button>
<p id="message">Ready.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="label">STRATEGY</div>
<div class="value">EMA + RSI</div>
<p>Rule-based strategy. No live market data is connected.</p>
</div>
<a href="./index.html">← Back to Home</a>
</main>
</body>
</html>
